 /* Firearms */
+/* Dasunt's Firearms Patch
+ * 	I find it foolish to have weapons that are basically worthless 
+ * 	because of their weight.  In addition, for the damage done, 
+ * 	rockets are way too heavy.
+ *
+ * Two-handed weapons are also too heavy to reflect the penalty of their use.
+ *
+ * Adjustments:
+ * 	heavy machine gun:  	500 -> 65
+ * 		( old weapon weighted 460 more then the assault rifle, 
+ * 		  had a larger penalty to hit, and only fired 3 more shots/
+ * 		  round then the assault rifle, which is also 1-handed vs
+ * 		  being two handed )
+ * 	sniper rifle:		 50 -> 35
+ * 		( two handed, slow rate of fire, adjusted to be between 
+ * 		  rifle and assault rifle )
+ * 	auto shotgun:		 60 -> 40
+ * 		( two handed )
+ * 	rocket launcher:	750 -> 80 
+ * 		( two handed weapon that weighs 730 more then the 
+ * 		  pistol, dispite rockets only doing double the damage of 
+ * 		  bullets.  In addition, it has a slower rate of fire, and 
+ * 		  bigger penalty to hit then the pistol. )
+ * 	rocket:			200 -> 25 
+ * 		( bullets do half damage, can be fired from a one-handed 
+ * 		  launcher, and can be fired from a launcher with a 
+ * 		  much higher ROF.  A /oFireball does the same area damage, 
+ * 		  but weighs only 7.  Its more weight-effective to carry 
+ * 		  an assault rifle and a /oFireball then it is to use a 
+ * 		  rocket launcher!  )
+ * 	frag|gas grenade:	25 -> 20
+ * 	stick of dynamite:	30 -> 15
